  "Original central warehouse and surrounding camp concept":"原始中央仓库与周边军营概念","Early island layout with widely distributed buildings and roads":"建筑与道路分布较散的早期岛屿布局","Early military-camp arrangement and environmental density":"早期军营布局与环境密度","Large-scale initial island before the first reduction":"首次缩减前的大型初始岛屿",
