  "I enclosed the Military Camp with barbed-wire boundaries to establish a stronger military identity and clearly separate it from the Rainforest. I then introduced platforming challenges and environmental obstacles throughout the level, drawing on classic platform games to make exploration more engaging.":"我用铁丝网围合军营，强化军事区域特征并与雨林清晰分隔；随后参考经典平台游戏，在关卡中加入平台挑战和环境障碍，让探索更有趣。",
