  "I replaced constant UI arrows with layered environmental guidance. Large landmarks establish long-range goals, paths and signposts support route choice, and local contrast makes objectives and interactable props readable without breaking exploration.":"我用分层环境引导替代持续显示的 UI 箭头。大型地标建立远程目标，路径和路牌辅助路线选择，局部对比则在不打断探索的情况下让目标与交互物清晰可见。",
  "Place a glowing jerky objective near the starting area so players immediately understand the collection goal":"在起点附近放置发光肉干目标，让玩家立即理解收集任务",
