  "I reworked the complete island layout and reduced its scale again. Because of the limited production schedule, the central granary was removed and the Military Camp became the main destruction and exploration space. Clear routes, isolated ability-learning moments, visible jerky rewards and stronger landmarks were then used to control pacing without restricting free exploration.":"我重新调整完整岛屿布局并再次缩小规模。由于制作周期有限，中央粮仓被移除，军营成为主要破坏与探索空间。随后通过清晰路线、独立能力学习环节、可见肉干奖励和更强地标控制节奏，同时不限制自由探索。",
